%abc-2.1
% Melody, chords and words transcribed by hand from the writer's own lead sheet,
% sources/sheetPdf.pdf (larryholdermusic.org/scores/evenme_with_piano.pdf), bar for
% bar, in the PDF's key (A) and metre (6/8). Bar numbers match the PDF. The piano left
% hand and the inner voices are not transcribed.
% Form as printed: the repeat runs from bar 22 to the first ending (bars 58-59); the
% writer's MIDI plays verse 1, refrain, verse 2, refrain, then takes the second ending
% (bar 60) in place of bar 37 on the second refrain.
% Checked against the melody track of sources/tune.mid (tools/check-abc-midi.py).
% Where the two differ the PDF wins: the MIDI sings "by" / "til" (bars 14, 52), one note of
% "sure that God's" (bar 30) on E and "and" (bar 24) on B, where the PDF has F#; it drops
% the C# of "in-side" (bar 28) and the F# of "love" (bar 31), and splits "heav'n" and
% "giv'n" (bars 45, 49) into two notes. The MIDI is in A, like the PDF.
X:1
T:Even Me
C:Words and Music by Larry Holder
Z:Transcribed from the writer's lead sheet (2000, 2011)
M:6/8
L:1/8
K:A
